WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.202
-How are you? How are you doing?
-Eh.

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:03.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah?
-Eh.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just "eh"?
-Yeah.

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.574 size:88% position:44%
You know, okay, I guess.

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:08.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What am I supposed to say?
"Great"? You know...

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A lot of people say "great."
-Hate those people.

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.383 size:78% position:39%
-They stick a "great"
on you right away?

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:17.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-You don´t do that.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Why? What´s the --
-It´s rude. It´s rude.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:22.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, so I´m inferior
to you ´cause you´re great?

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:25.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
And what?
I´m not so great, I guess.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.227
-Maybe you´re also -- Two people
can be great at the same time.

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:28.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don´t think so.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don´t say that
in polite society.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:33.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And if you really want to
draw it out of me,

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.200
okay, I´m pretty damn good.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.435
-All right, good. Thank you.

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:37.937
Thank you for your honesty.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How does that make you feel?
-I feel...

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:41.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m happy.
-How are you?

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:42.675
I´m happy on your behalf.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:43.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Are you happy?
-I am.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.346
-I don´t think so.
I think you´re a little jealous.

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:47.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, now,
I am a little jealous.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I do. I feel you´re
a little jealous.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:52.385
-You know, I have to say this --
you´ve not been here before,

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you´ve been discussed
on this show before.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.589
You have come up.
Other guests have mentioned you.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:57.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Mm. Yes, yes.

00:00:57.524 --> 00:00:59.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you know who
I´m referring to?

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:02.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I have seen
one of those guests,

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the person of
Jennifer Lawrence.

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:10.370
And she sat right here and
she said she had a crush on you.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:13.807 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And she also said
she also had a crush on me.

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, she did.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:20.013
-And when you heard that she had
a crush on me, as well...

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:25.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:27.087
...you seemed quite displeased

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:32.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we were lumped together,
as if that detracted from

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:35.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
the ego trip
that you were on, yeah.

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:37.197 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I do remember that.
-Yes.

00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:38.698 size:84% position:42%
-I recall that reaction

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:40.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then having great shame
about that reaction.

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then, you know, waking up
in the middle of the night

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:47.240
and shaking my wife awake and
said, "I did an awful thing."

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:51.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know what?
I was expecting a call.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:52.612 size:75% position:38%
The call never came.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.514
-But you were happy to be
lumped together with me?

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:56.983
Wouldn´t you rather --
-Look, I´m not gonna lie.

00:01:56.983 --> 00:02:02.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
It would have been better
if it was just me.

00:02:02.489 --> 00:02:06.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
When she said you,
I, too, was disappointed.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:09.496 size:88% position:44%
-Yeah. ´Cause both of us
would rather if it was

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:11.731 size:88% position:44%
you plus George Clooney.

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:14.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then you feel that
you´re now this --

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.769
-No. I don´t want George Clooney
in the picture either.

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:20.874
-Okay. You just want nothing --
-I wanted me, just me.

00:02:20.874 --> 00:02:22.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
To me, it takes away
from the crush

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:23.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
if she´s mentioning
other people.

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:24.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:25.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How special is it,
then, for me?

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:27.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s not that special.
-Right.

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.782 size:84% position:42%
You got a crush on me.
You got a crush on him.

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:30.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-No good.

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:31.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right. I see.

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:33.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
You want the one --
You want a solo crush.

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:35.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want the big crush, yes.
-Yeah. All right.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:36.422
Well, we´ll have to let her know

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:38.057 align:start size:94% position:6%
that this isn´t working
for either of us.

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:39.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:41.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
We saw each other at
the SNL 40th,

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:45.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
which, for me,
next to my wedding,

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:46.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
was as memorable a night
as I´ve ever had,

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:47.800
as far as so many people.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you have a fun time
at that event?

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:50.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, not really.
-Okay.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:51.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:54.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I left --
I went to the party after.

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:56.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
I left after about
45, 50 minutes.

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:58.511 size:75% position:38%
-Very early to leave
a party like that.

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:01.881
-Yes. And then, afterwards,
the next day, I found out,

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:05.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, right after you left,
Paul McCartney sang

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:08.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then Bruce Springsteen,
the Rolling Stones,

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:10.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
and John Lennon came back
from the dead."

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:12.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know.

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:14.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, good things seem to
happen when I leave.

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:15.895 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:17.096 size:81% position:41%
-No matter where I am,

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:19.666 size:78% position:39%
wonderful things take
place after I´m gone.

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:21.467 size:84% position:42%
Like, it´s not uncommon
for me to get a call

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:24.037
the next day after a party --
"After you left -- You´re crazy.

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:25.471
I don´t know why you left."

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:27.774
Four women took their clothes
off and jumped in the pool.

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:32.011 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, it was a bacchanal.
You missed a bacchanal."

